					<a href="/blog/turkish-coffee-guide/" class="border border-cream/20 text-cream/70 px-5 py-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest hover:border-copper/50 hover:text-cream transition-all">
						Turkish Coffee Guide
					</a>
					<a href="/blog/vietnamese-phin-guide/" class="border border-cream/20 text-cream/70 px-5 py-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest hover:border-copper/50 hover:text-cream transition-all">
